cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Prompt2Box in your work, please cite it."
title: "Prompt2Box: Gemini object detection in one import"
abstract: >-
  A small Python library and CLI that returns labeled pixel-space bounding boxes
  for items in a local image using Google's Gemini vision models.
type: software
authors:
